notes.content:
[list]
[*] Redesign Visitor Generator;
[*] Redesigned ID card;
[*] Added new Visitor attribute: Height;
[*] Fixed few issues;
[/list]

[h1]Bugs[/h1]
[list]
[*] While trainin, a visitor leave while interacting with dialogue menu;
[*] If you wait until 9 on the main screen, the view is transferred to the table and you are prompted to scan documents without documents;
[*] When you press "Skip" on the computer before scanning the document, then it is impossible to scan it;
[*] While training a visitor can leave;
[*] Fix localisations;
[/list]

[h1]Features[/h1]
[list]
[*] Changed hitbox for documents holder.
[*] Add a "Wait a little more" dialogue option, which adds a bit of time (eg 30% of the base wait) but reduces the reward for getting it right;
[*] Ather small changes;
[/list]

Features:
[list]
[*] New Feature: Browser, where you can order food, check your bank account and much more (in future updates...);
[*] Camera filter based on energy, if you don't eat in time, your health will affect the game, the screen will turn gray and all animations will slow down;
[*] Added Food delivery feature, after you will meet with deliverer you will access to food delivery site;
[*] Added Bank feature;
[/list]

Chores:
[list]
[*] Slow down camera animation;
[*] Rework summary window;
[/list]

[list]
[*] Fatal error on ending work day screen;
[/list]

Features:
[list]
[*] Generate only possible family members, based on age, but when fake documen, visitor could say anything;
[*] Added first side quest;
[*] Decrease size of project
[*] Minor changes;
[/list]

Bugs:
[list]
[*] Email on day 4 doesn't replacing with numbers;
[/list]

[list]
[*] Added scenario for day 3;
[*] Fixed bug: Valid last visit generate in future date;
[*] Hide non-interactable objects;
[*] Now when visitor has goal reason [u]family[/u] and fake family members, you could check it on dialo vindow;
[*] Bunch of minor changes;
[/list]

[list]
[*] Monitor interable while help dialog requires click on invite button object;
[*] In first day quest email text  duplicates for UK languages;
[*] On the second day, an always unsuccessful scenario is selected, even if you completed the previous day's quest;
[*] While help interactable objects not blinking;
[*] Issue with Quest #2, progress updating after wrong processed visitor instead of successfully;
[/list]

Fixes for issues
[list]
[*] Window opens blured if been closed while loading details window;
[*] Game crashes if hover inactive visitor window and click on enter
[*] Fix hight gamma for end day screen;
[*] Incorrectly checks after declining of visitor with multiple day rules;
[*] Hidding Email Window while in help mode;
[/list]

Features
[list]
[*] On monitor highlight active window button;
[*] Shows different statuses for each windows;
[*] Add day 2 scenario;
[/list]

Fixes for issues
[list]
[*] Proper checking of resolving of quests by days;
[*] Incorect displaying data on documents;
[/list]

Features
[list]
[*] Reimplement last visit attribute, insteadof single date visitor will have multiple dates;
[/list]
